{
  "name": "Generate AI videos with Seedance and post them to TikTok",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Generate AI videos with Seedance and post them to TikTok\n\n### Who's it for\n\nCreators and marketers who want AI written posts published automatically.\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs when you click Execute Workflow.\n2. Sets the topic, text, or other inputs used to build the post.\n3. Generates platform-optimized post text with the OpenAI model.\n4. Calls an external API over HTTP (media generation, status polling, or download).\n5. Checks whether the AI media finished generating; retries until ready.\n6. Pauses between status checks while the AI media renders.\n7. Publishes a post to TikTok via the SocialRobot API.\n\n### How to set up\n\n- [ ] Install the SocialRobot community node, then create an API key at [socialrobot.io](https://socialrobot.io) (Scheduler -> API Keys) and connect your SocialRobot API credential.\n- [ ] Edit the fields in the Set node to set your topic or text.\n- [ ] Connect your OpenAI account in the OpenAI Chat Model node.\n- [ ] Connect your Replicate account in the HTTP Request nodes (media generation, status checks, and download).\n- [ ] Select your connected account in each Publish node.\n\n### Requirements\n\n- A [SocialRobot](https://socialrobot.io) account with connected social channels and an API key.\n- An [OpenAI API key](https://platform.openai.com/api-keys), connected in the OpenAI Chat Model node.\n- A public image or video URL for TikTok.\n",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 1070
      },
      "id": "f2a61731-4c8c-43f7-ab0a-de0d511500b5",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        40
      ]
    },
